+# T-0160 — Record the billing-source CDC schemas from a scratch org (Opportunity, OpportunityLineItem, Order, OrderItem) and confirm IsWon in changedFields
+
+## Goal
+T-0069 built the Closed Won trigger against documented, not recorded, Avro schemas (fixtures/documented/pubsub-billing-source-change-events.json, RQ-0124 F4). Record redacted change events from a scratch org into fixtures/recorded/ and replace the documented fixture in the contract test.
+
+## Context (design refs)
+- Created 2026-11-09 by claude as a follow-up of [T-0069](T-0069.md) (RQ-0124, DL-0370..DL-0375).
+- Specs: [UC-01](../../Docs/specs/UC-01.md)
+
+## Scope
+- Record OpportunityChangeEvent (stage change to Closed Won), OpportunityLineItemChangeEvent (create/update/delete), OrderChangeEvent (activation) and OrderItemChangeEvent with a scratch org, redacted (no real ids, users or tokens).
+- Confirm whether IsWon/IsClosed appear in changedFields on a stage change (RQ-0124 S4 open point), the Avro type of Date (int days) and Currency (double) fields, and update RQ-0124 with the finding.
+- Contract test runs against the recorded payloads; the documented fixture is kept and marked superseded (never deleted).
+
+## Open questions (→ research before start)
+- [ ] Needs a scratch org authenticated outside the repo (salesforce-engineer).
+
+## Acceptance criteria (each maps to a test + SS id; add an SS row at claim)
+- [ ] AC-1 (contract) The recorded events decode into the same billing changes as the documented ones (dates YYYY-MM-DD, amounts exact decimal text).
+- [ ] AC-2 (contract) A recorded Closed Won UPDATE is recognised as won by isTriggered.
+
+## Steps
