+# T-0162 — Invoice template records and party payment terms for Closed Won drafts (design §4.3, §4.2)
+
+## Goal
+T-0069 drafts with a fixed template: one invoice per source, lines = line items, tax-exclusive TotalPrice, due date = invoice date + salesforce_billing_settings.payment_terms_days (default 14, GP-001 terms). Design §4.3 makes the format a template record (line source, grouping, tax treatment, numbering series, PDF layout, email template) and §4.2 gives the party its own payment terms.
